---
source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
error[use_after_free]: `holder` is used after the call above freed it
  --> tests/lint/use_after_free/bad.jai:23:22
   |
21 | rename :: (holder: *Holder) {
   |            --------------- storage derived here
22 |     release_holder(holder);
   |     ---------------------- storage invalidated here
23 |     print("was %\n", holder.name);
   |                      ^^^^^^
   |
   = help: free it after its last use, or give it a new value before using it again
   = note: `use_after_free` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

error[use_after_free]: `node` is used after the call above freed it
  --> tests/lint/use_after_free/bad.jai:31:34
   |
27 |     node := New(Node);
   |             --------- storage derived here
   ...
30 |     free(node);
   |     ---------- storage invalidated here
31 |     print("freed node held %\n", node.value);
   |                                  ^^^^
   |
   = help: free it after its last use, or give it a new value before using it again
   = note: `use_after_free` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

